sequenceDiagram
  participant I as IMU
  participant P as Pico
  participant O as LED / sound
  participant S as Laptop service
  participant D as SQLite
  participant B as Browser
  participant N as Phone
  loop ~20 Hz
    P->>I: Read acceleration
    I-->>P: ax, ay, az or error
    P->>P: Filter, validate, classify, qualify dwell, update timer
    P->>O: Update local alarm
  end
  P->>S: JSON summary and events (~1 Hz)
  S->>D: Insert sample and event rows
  opt Raised alert and NTFY_TOPIC configured
    S->>N: HTTPS notification request
  end
  B->>S: GET /api/status (~1 Hz)
  S->>D: Read events and shift summary
  S-->>B: latest data, age, shift, events
  Note over B: >5 s without fresh data: stale indication
